   <platform os="all" arch="noarch" version="1.9.4:1.9.9">
      <package fileName="kscripts.zip" sha1="6b3317ba7d8c05c6b1dbd8683edd4296b4bf4fe4" type="script" releaseDate="2026-06-15T12:54:49Z">
         <title>
        kScripts Suite V1.1 (Major Update)
      </title>
         <description>
            <h2>kScripts Suite - Now compatible with new V8 JavaScript Engine</h2>
            <p>This update ports the entire kScripts Suite to the new high-performance V8 JavaScript engine.</p>
            <ul>
               <li>
                  <b>Full V8 Runtime Support:</b> Optimized for PixInsight 1.9.4+.</li>
               <li>
                  <b>General Improvements:</b> Internal cleanup, more readable naming map structures, and modern ECMAScript code optimizations.</li>
               <li>
                  <b>Bug Fixes:</b> Addressed minor issues related to the legacy SpiderMonkey engine transition.</li>
               <li>
                  <b>Removed kFastRename:</b> Removed from the suite to streamline the package and focus on core image processing tools.</li>
            </ul>
            <p>Copyright (c) 2026 Igor Koprowicz. All Rights Reserved. Based on software from the PixInsight project, developed by Pleiades Astrophoto (https://pixinsight.com/).</p>
         </description>
      </package>
   </platform>
